<title>CHINA: China Jan-June crude, natural gas output up.</title>
<headline>China Jan-June crude, natural gas output up.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>China produced 80.8215 million tonnes of crude oil in the first half of this year, up 3.2 percent compared with the year-ago period, said a report issued by the State Statistical Bureau on Thursday.</p>
<p>China produced 13.4398 million tonnes of crude oil in June alone, the bureau said.</p>
<p>China's natural gas output reached 11.872 billion cubic metres from Januatry to June, up 7.3 percent compared with the same year-ago period, it said.</p>
<p>Natural gas output in June alone was 1.939 billion cubic metres, it said.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532-1921</p>
